ble\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>\"For Alone, We Are as Good as Dead...\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">「我们已孑然一身，与死无异…」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Wǒmen Yǐ Jiérán-yīshēn, yǔ Sǐ Wúyì...\"</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">\"We Are Now Kinless and Alone, No Different From the Dead...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我們已孑然一身，與死無異…」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Wǒmen Yǐ Jiérán-yīshēn, yǔ Sǐ Wúyì...\"</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">「私たちはみな独法師だ</span> <span lang=\"ja\">我らが身は屍も同然…」</span><br /><small><i>\"Watashi-tachi wa Mina Hitoribocchi da Wareraga Mi wa Shikabane mo Douzen...\"</i></small></td><td>\"Our Bodies Are as Good as Dead When We Are Alone...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">「고독한</span> <span lang=\"ko\">우리는</span> <span lang=\"ko\">망자와</span> <span lang=\"ko\">다름없으나…」</span><br /><small><i>\"Godokhan Urineun Mangjawa Dareumeopseuna...\"</i></small></td><td>\"We are Lonely, thus No Different From the Dead...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Nuestra soledad se equipara a la muerte</td><td>Our Solitude Is the Same as Death</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td><span lang=\"fr\">«</span>&#160;Car seuls, c'est la mort qui nous attend...&#160;<span lang=\"fr\">»</span></td><td>\"For Alone, It Is Death that Awaits Us...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">«По</span> <span lang=\"ru\">одиночке</span> <span lang=\"ru\">мы</span> <span lang=\"ru\">всё</span> <span lang=\"ru\">равно</span> <span lang=\"ru\">что</span> <span lang=\"ru\">мертвы</span>...<span lang=\"ru\">»</span><br /><small><i>\"Po odinochke my vsyo ravno chto mertvy...\"</i></small></td><td>\"Individually We Are as Good as Dead...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>\"For Alone, We Are as Good as Dead...<wbr />\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">\"Vì Một Mình Khác Gì Với Đã Chết...\"</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td><span lang=\"de\">„</span>Allein sind wir so gut wie tot ...<wbr /><span lang=\"de\">“</span></td><td>\"Alone We Are as Good as Dead...\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>\"For Alone, We Are as Good as Dead ...\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>\"Sozinhos, Estamos Mortos...\"</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>\"Yaln<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>zl<span lang=\"tr\">ığı</span>m<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>z <span lang=\"tr\">Ö</span>l<span lang=\"tr\">ü</span>mle Birdir...\"</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>\"Nella solitudine, siamo come spoglie esanimi...\"</td><td>\"In Loneliness, We Are Like Lifeless Remains...\"</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522For_Alone%2C_We_Are_as_Good_as_Dead...%2522%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/4.6\" title=\"Version/4.6\">Version 4.6</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=